    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Rejuvenation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen a last guard is destroyed, they re-form after 2d4 days within the location they're bound to, fully healed. A last guard can be permanently destroyed and move on to the afterlife only if they successfully defend the location they're bound to from large-scale attack, or fulfill a call to war."
            },
            "id": "129bd57a-c6fb-49ce-8e5c-a4ae24674cae",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:28.527612"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
